"長野県","municipality_name":"宮田村","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"610"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[137.85105895996094,35.7965087890625]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"不動滝","category":"nature","address":"河川景観 / 滝","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"20388","municipality_pref":"長野県","municipality_name":"宮田村","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"610"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[137.871337890625,35.767494201660156]}}],"display_comment_original":"宮田村周辺には、近世村の記憶として宮田村、中越村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場に関わる場所が見え、姫宮遺跡、中越遺跡、熊野寺跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、宮田村、中越村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに田・新田・用水の地名が多く、土地改良碑や用水記念碑が見つかる可能性がある。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["加藤清治","唐木順三","向山雅重"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["カモシカ","旧新井家住宅（宮田宿本陣）","中越遺跡出土品","中越遺跡","中央アルプス駒ケ岳","熊野寺の薬師如来像","熊野寺の聖観音菩薩像","全昌寺の薬師如来像"],"specialties":["信州みやだワイン紫輝","南信州ビール","紫輝彩丼"],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%AE%E7%94%B0%E6%9D%91","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q108111248","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1728914","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q56348394"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"宮田村","wikipedia_revision_id":"110136026","wikidata_qid":"Q959501","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%AE%E7%94%B0%E6%9D%91","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}